Package: systemPipeRdata
Title: systemPipeRdata: Workflow templates and sample data
Version: 2.17.3
Date: 2026-10-21
Authors@R: person("Thomas", "Girke", email = "thomas.girke@ucr.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Encoding: UTF-8
biocViews: ExperimentData, ReproducibleResearch, SequencingData,
        RNASeqData, ChIPSeqData, DNASeqData, SingleCellData,
        Arabidopsis_thaliana_Data, Homo_sapiens_Data
Description: systemPipeRdata complements the systemPipeR workflow management
        system (WMS) by offering a collection of pre-designed data analysis workflow
        templates. These templates are easily accessible and can be readily loaded onto
        a user's system with a single command. Once loaded, the WMS can immediately
        utilize these templates for efficient end-to-end analysis, serving a wide range 
        of data analysis needs. 
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: methods, Biostrings, BiocGenerics, jsonlite, remotes, BiocFileCache
Suggests: GenomicFeatures, DT, txdbmaker, GenomicRanges, IRanges, Rsamtools, ShortRead, rtracklayer, RUnit, BiocStyle, knitr, rmarkdown, systemPipeR, kableExtra, magrittr, dplyr, gert, crayon
VignetteBuilder: knitr
